  "notes": "Cause code is TBD/provisional per form field; underlying root cause of connection ring failure was still under investigation pending generator disassembly and repair at time of report. Three previous similar occurrences of turbine/reactor trips from main generator protective relaying actuation cited (LER 2013-008, LER 2014-006, LER 2020-006), all at Callaway Plant Unit 1, modeled as stub LER nodes. AFW and main feedwater isolation are described as automatic responses per plant design consistent with high-power reactor trip, not stated-operable backups to a failed system per se, but AFW actuation is explicitly stated to have occurred as expected in response to the trip so it is modeled as mitigating the trip consequence. OCR quality in narrative was poor; text reconstructed based on context."
